# ==============================================================================
# Rust & Cargo
# ==============================================================================
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
cargo-timing.html
# Note: Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored because bgone is an application binary.
# Keeping Cargo.lock in version control guarantees reproducible builds across systems.

